cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or its released runs, please cite the paper below."
title: "memory-transfer-harness"
abstract: >-
  A replay harness for extrinsic evaluation of agent memory systems: it replays conversational
  search dialogues through each memory system and scores the document rankings that the
  system's memory causes a frozen retrieval pipeline to return.
authors:
  - family-names: Ng
    given-names: Siu Hin
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mnsh0409/memory-transfer-harness"
keywords:
  - conversational search
  - agent memory
  - extrinsic evaluation
  - TREC CAsT
  - information retrieval
